# The calendar's player-facing words: how a requirement on a calendar reading is named, and how an
# attendance step reads when its own file names no sentence.
# The file name is the key PREFIX: an entry here resolves as ziggfreedcommon.calendar.<key>.

factor.calendar_live = a calendar event running
factor.calendar_year = the year of a running calendar event
factor.feature = a feature this server has switched on

# The attendance step: {1} is the event it names. The .any twin reads when a step names no event.
objective.calendar_attended = Take part in {1}
objective.calendar_attended.any = Take part in a seasonal event
